This module is an independent client for the MiniMax Code app-server protocol.
Protocol shapes were recovered from the MIT-licensed npm package
@minimax-ai/code version 0.7.8
(tarball SHA-256 f497f02bac0f8fc8ad3791d59e8827208684ab466bec94cd7702594d19f5735a),
published by MiniMax. This repository does not vendor that CLI, its native
addons, or its embedded runtimes.

The wire protocol is MiniMax's. It is not the OpenAI Codex app-server protocol,
and this module does not claim Codex wire compatibility.
